Introduction : With FDA approval of a medication for the restless legs
syndrome (RLS) (and other approvals expected), a wider range of med-
ical professionals will be expected to recognize and treat RLS. A single
valid screening question would provide significant support to the process
of reliably identifying those who suffer from RLS.